      "filePath": "src/modules/MainApp/Integrations/hooks/lsp/useDevToolManager.ts",
      "summary": "Generic, domain-agnostic hook that manages the shared lifecycle for Tauri dev-tool integrations — cache-first item loading, a per-item install/uninstall action state machine with auto-reset timers, and workspace enable/disable toggling — so it can back both LSP language-server and lint-tool UIs.",
      "tags": ["hook", "state-machine", "generic", "lsp", "tauri-invoke"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "Generic over a TItem type parameter with all Tauri command names and the item payload key injected by the caller, keeping the implementation domain-agnostic; uses a mounted-ref guard plus a Set of pending setTimeout handles to avoid state updates and leaked timers after unmount."
    },
    {
